OL,3,GNEWSARoad closures as key roundabout
OL,4,Aresurfaced
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are being urged to plan ahead
OL,7,Fas a major Bournemouth roundabout
OL,8,Fundergoes resurfacing, with a series of
OL,9,Froad closures planned.
OL,11,FBCP Council said the A3060 Broadway
OL,12,Froundabout connecting Castle Lane West
OL,13,Fand Charminster Road needs to be
OL,14,Fresurfaced to improve the road surface
OL,15,Fand make it last longer.
OL,17,FThe work, over five days and in two
OL,18,Fphases, will first see a short stretch
OL,19,Fof Castle Lane West approaching the
OL,20,Froundabout from the west and a section
OL,21,Fof Broadway Lane resurfaced.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
