OL,3,GNEWSARoad closures as key roundabout
OL,4,Aresurfaced
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe roundabout will be open to traffic
OL,7,Fgoing in or out of B3063 Charminster
OL,8,FRoad and to or from Cooper Dean
OL,9,Froundabout. The work is set to take
OL,10,Fplace on Wednesday and Thursday from
OL,11,F20:00 to 06:00 GMT.
